<title>USA: Columbus, Wis., won by Firstar Bank.</title>
<headline>Columbus, Wis., won by Firstar Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firstar Bank said it won $1.375 million of Columbus, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.07 percent.</p>
</text>
